{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And He overturned those cities.</b> It should have said 'those cities' (את הערים ההם), yet it says האל — because he mentioned Sodom and Amorah above, and the verse alludes to you that there were five cities in the count of HaShem, for this reason Abraham sought fifty righteous men, ten for each and every town, and from this comes ״ויהפך את הערים האל״ — and they were Sodom and Amorah, Admah and Zeboiym, and the land of the plain."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:37.402579721Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}